                  "contents": { },
                  "orphan_state": { },
                  "description": "When true, the HDR VPID fields (Gamma Curve / Color Space / Luminance / Signal Range) below override the SMPTE 352 VPID that the driver auto-generates on this SDI output. When false, the driver's default VPID is emitted unchanged (the base VPID is always present regardless).",
                  "display_name": "Enable VPID"
                },
